  "ruleText": "Saf-C 5901.90 “Refresher training program (RTP)” means a division approved training program designed to refresh the skills and knowledge of an emergency medical care provider.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 and Revision Note #2 at Chapter heading for Saf-C 5900) #12790, eff 5-24-19",
